{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02902","headline":"奉和太子纳妃太平公主出降三首 三 · 裴守真","name":"奉和太子纳妃太平公主出降三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"藂云霭晓光，湛露曦朝阳。\n天文天景丽，睿藻睿词芳。\n玉庭散秋色，银宫生夕凉。\n太平超邃古，万寿乐无疆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴守真","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02902.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02902","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}